   ],
   "expected_not_screened": [
    "tdg-app-2025q2"
   ],
   "why": "R-29 groups TDG and tdg as one key. Reported TDG-group dates: 2024-09-30, 2025-02-04 (app q1), 2025-02-04 (retained tie); latest 2025-02-04 and the tie keeps both. tdg-retained-2024 is another reported run, excluded. tdg-app-2025q2 has no report and is dated after 2025-02-04, so it stays as not screened. ALDM has one reported run. Unclassified is its own group and stays, screened. tdg-app-2024q4 (2024-12-15, reported) is older than the latest, so excluded."
  },
